+# Worker-Audit Phase 3 Rollup
+
+All 44 pair reports are included. Pair citations use `03-02` as shorthand for `epoch-03-pair-02`.
+
+## Scoreboard
+
+| Worker | systematic | mixed | shotgun | Total |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
